{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993247727973001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wait-solar-haste","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Joe Oakhart","head_sha":"7d0b4e5b614e40d2a747d70ea62338109e0d5269","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: 090f-4f7c-44ba-49ae","material: 3d824970509365c7","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 11","rebar-version: 0.6.0 (7d0b4e5b6-dirty)","regver: bb57585159a067c5","verified-at-sha:ba88d7da5cb526e64c9befa060e0e02a9e902850","dep 1269fd60a3097c8458b9c070c01a77e2a4e734308d6e16357acdf4e148487cf6 src/rebar/_reads.py","dep f0d5993c8e053752a736a83059f8e7b9085212b2e26f076aa6112c6ffbe2f15b src/rebar/mcp_server.py","dep 84cb038da85935350eb26764c005916b9a4232bbcb6b4bd35ef7086593c397e9 src/rebar/schemas/verify_signature_result.schema.json"],"signature":"20992d3e4c2f4c86ee13461a9c6ca5edce04ad5854ef23f3f680403ae4e58a30","signed_at":1783128980423517000}},"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":6},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783123877215774001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"## Why\n\nProvenance an auditor can't see isn't useful. The gate-code version+SHA stamp\n(stories 1-2) must be visible where attestations are inspected (epic\njira-reb-596).\n\n## What\n\n- Surface `manifest_rebar_version()` output in the `show` attestation rendering\n  (attestation data rides in the ticket state dict; render it in the show path in\n  `src/rebar/_reads.py` / `src/rebar/__init__.py` alongside the certified/verdict\n  block, HMAC still stripped).\n- Add the stamp to `verify_signature`'s return payload AND its typed contract:\n  the `VerifySignatureResultOut` model in `src/rebar/mcp_server.py` and the JSON\n  schema `src/rebar/schemas/verify_signature_result.schema.json` (new **nullable\n  string** field, e.g. `rebar_version`).\n- Pre-stamp manifests -> field is `None` / omitted; render nothing (no crash).\n\n## Scope\n\nRead/display surface + typed-contract extension only. Consumes story 1's parser.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `rebar show <id>` displays the gate-code version+SHA for a stamped\n      attestation.\n- [ ] `verify_signature` returns the stamp; `VerifySignatureResultOut` and\n      `verify_signature_result.schema.json` are extended with the nullable field.\n- [ ] A pre-stamp attestation shows/returns no stamp (field `None`) without error.\n- [ ] Tests cover `show` AND `verify_signature` for stamped and pre-stamp\n      attestations, including the schema/model validation of the new field.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_reads.py","reason":"render stamp in show attestation block"},{"path":"src/rebar/mcp_server.py","reason":"add field to VerifySignatureResultOut"},{"path":"src/rebar/schemas/verify_signature_result.schema.json","reason":"add nullable rebar_version field"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","jira-reb-596"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"jira-reb-596","parent_status_uuid":"297d1827-68c1-4224-a910-a0fbb7de6696","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"090f-4f7c-44ba-49ae","ticket_type":"story","title":"Surface rebar-version stamp in show + verify_signature","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cf7f00ad-f1e1-4b2f-9d89-b957df869d86","7754e16c-61fa-4103-b138-d43a83f5ed6f","6ff67995-3331-4fcc-8821-d855026b4a5f","fcd96101-91c6-4d9d-9bef-36d9b2540265","bc1db5fe-370a-45f2-b717-78e3fc8dda5b","297d1827-68c1-4224-a910-a0fbb7de6696","9c55b9ec-6527-4653-b364-1c745371cb72","2527e633-90e2-47dd-9d9e-ca62d1892f5d"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993247727973001,"uuid":"32f1f6c8-a319-44ea-903a-aadd10a25c45"}